{"id": "DfaKfKZRTnz", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Dushman kabhi gale nahi lagte… yahi to farq hai. 🥀\n\nWoh kaanton se bachke nahi chala, phoolon ki taraf chala, kyunki phool to apne laaye the.\nPehla dost gale mila, guldasta seene se lagaya… aur dil pe ek gulaab khil gaya.\nAjnabi paas se guzre, kisi ne haath tak nahi lagaya.\nBachpan ki woh tasveer, chaar dost ek bargad ke neeche, chatak ke toot gayi.\nAakhir mein teen dost khade the, teeno ke haath mein khaali dandiyan… aur teeno ke phool uske dil par. 🌹\n\nNusrat Fateh Ali Khan saab ki “Jitne Bhi Zakham Hai Mere Dil Par” har us insaan ki awaaz hai jise gairon ne nahi, apnon ne toda. NFAK, sad qawwali, dosti aur dhokha, sab ek misre mein 🤍\n\nलोग कांटो से बच के चलते हैं\nहमने फूलों से जख्म खाए हैं\nतुम तो गैरों की बात करते हो\nहमने अपने भी आजमाए हैं\nजितने भी जख्म है मेरे दिल पर\nदोस्तों के लगाए हुए है\n\n🎵 Jitne Bhi Zakham Hai Mere Dil Par · Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan\n\nUs dost ko bhejo jo aaj bhi saath hai… aur us ko bhi jisne sikha diya ki phool bhi chubhte hain 🥀\n\n#nusratfatehalikhan #nfak #betrayal", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793986938, "like_count": 213981, "comment_count": 173, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2256560635271340a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 75.671, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN7gEvycAcYl_Vi3rtn8Y73bycXBOYCGelLdi4uErXh2-QwR04-Q9-0WY0AcaJP-XleI0I77B1ePunP7Mrhe0JBK7a0WX7gLfB9p1U.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoMJy28N4KHBS9TD3tqL0JJa6us_oiJHoxUfe-W3HxhTLeWCEyzT